<title>USA: Apache Corp names Roger Plank CFO.</title>
<headline>Apache Corp names Roger Plank CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apache Corp said Monday it named Roger Plank vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Plank previously was vice president of planning and corporate development at the oil and gas company. He joined Apache in 1981.</p>
<p>He replaces Mark Jackson, who has accepted a position with another company.</p>
